      "content": "SP 8707              WENDOVER               TRING ROAD north side 11/297                                      No.27 (12 Coldharbour) (formerly listed as No. 12 Coldharbour Terrace). 21/12/67 GV                                          II Cottage, part of terrace, C17 altered, timber framed, refaced in colourwashed brick. Thatched roof, brick chimney to LH. 1 eaves dormer. 1½ storeys, 1 bay, 3-light casement and door to RH, both with segmental arched heads. RCHM I. p.310. MONS. 41-45."
